Source: press
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Zach <cress_07loaners@icloud.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, fontconfig, libxkbcommon-dev, pkgconf
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/supersolvers/press

Package: libpress1
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fontconfig
Description: PRESS widget toolkit runtime
 PRESS provides a widget engine with Wayland and headless rendering and
 loadable styles. This package contains the shared library, style plugins,
 and themes.

Package: libpress-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: libpress1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for the PRESS widget toolkit
 This package contains the C headers, linker symlink, and pkg-config
 metadata for building applications and style libraries against PRESS.
